# BNJI.NET — permanent redirects for the 2026-10-23 URL reorganization.
#
# Pages moved under their header categories (Projects / Community / Me).
# The old flat URLs are indexed and shared externally, so every one of them
# 301s to its new home forever. NEVER REMOVE A LINE: deleting one re-breaks
# every external link to that URL. /, /gizlyy/, /api/*, /admin/* and
# /rss.xml did not move and deliberately have no rules here.
#
# Both the trailing-slash form (the site's canonical shape) and the bare
# form are listed so neither depends on edge normalization. The splat rules
# carry every nested route (games, leaderboards, blog posts); the explicit
# /games/ and /blog/ index lines precede them so the catalog and the blog
# home resolve even if a splat ever stopped matching the empty tail.

# Projects
/lab/ /projects/lab/ 301
/lab /projects/lab/ 301
/tools/ /projects/tools/ 301
/tools /projects/tools/ 301
/games/ /projects/games/ 301
/games /projects/games/ 301
/games/* /projects/games/:splat 301

# Community
/board/ /community/board/ 301
/board /community/board/ 301
/messages/ /community/messages/ 301
/messages /community/messages/ 301
/friends/ /community/friends/ 301
/friends /community/friends/ 301

# Me
/blog/ /me/blog/ 301
/blog /me/blog/ 301
/blog/* /me/blog/:splat 301
/contact/ /me/contact/ 301
/contact /me/contact/ 301
/about/ /me/about/ 301
/about /me/about/ 301
